OL,3,GNEWSAJews still feel 'targets on backs'
OL,4,Ayear on from attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FJewish people still feel like they have
OL,7,F"a target on our backs" a year on from
OL,8,Fthe Manchester synagogue attack, a
OL,9,Fcommunity leader has said.
OL,11,FMark Levy, of the Jewish Representative
OL,12,FCouncil for Greater Manchester,
OL,13,Fdescribed the first anniversary of the
OL,14,Ftragedy at Heaton Park Synagogue as a
OL,15,Fday of "immense grief and trauma".
OL,17,FMelvin Cravitz, 66, and 53-year-old
OL,18,FAdrian Daulby, were killed when
OL,19,Fattacker Jihad Al-Shamie drove his car
OL,20,Finto the gates and began attacking
OL,21,Fworshippers with a knife.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
