OL,3,GNEWSAJews still feel 'targets on backs'
OL,4,Ayear on from attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe attack - which ended with
OL,7,F35-year-old Al-Shamie being shot dead
OL,8,Fby police - took place on Yom Kippur,
OL,9,Fthe holiest day in the Jewish calendar.
